{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-venetian","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"venetian-united-engineering-construction-dubai-sports-city","about":"Venetian is a 20-storey residential development that is part of the Canal Residence West project in Dubai Sports City, Dubai.Venetian offers studios and apartments with 1 to 3 bedrooms. Studios have a semi-enclosed modern kitchen, a spacious balcony, and a bedroom with attached bathroom. The apartments have a modern kitchen with appliances, spacious lounge, balcony and en-suite bedrooms. The three-bedroom apartments have an additional maid's room and laundry room.Venetian Residence residents have access to many services and amenities: covered parking, high-speed lifts, 24-hour security, central air conditioning, business centre for business meetings, state-of-the-art gym, swimming pool, health club, sauna, barbecue area, ground floor shops, children's playground, beauty salon, pharmacy, hairdresser, 24-hour concierge services.Within walking distance of Venetian are Renaissance School and Victory Heights Dwight School, The Wonder Years Nursery, Eupepsia Medical Clinic, Dhafar Park, Eisbej Park and Qesad Park. European Building and Arena Tower bus stops are a 5-minute walk away. Dubai International Airport and Al Maktoum Airport are a 30-minute drive from the residence.","price":770000,"title":"Venetian","bitrix":{"id":905,"pf_id":"are.3.3367","source":null,"project_id":"Canal Residence","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Venetian","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"United Engineering Construction","project_location":"Dubai Sports City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2643/images/2024/07/28/340x252/aMGepVgd77dtugBC3gaFQbqnPo4RAjTJhrXwlawG.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2643/images/2024/07/28/464x312/aMGepVgd77dtugBC3gaFQbqnPo4RAjTJhrXwlawG.webp"}],"st